        {
          "text": " Kandi abantu baamwo ndyabacwera orubanja, rubasingye, ahabw'obubi bwabo boona obwabantusigiiseho, bakooterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, bakaramya ebi emikono yaabo yaakozire. ",
